# Project rules

Read `docs/STATE.md` (last five entries) before starting. If this rule and the spec disagree, the spec wins: say so and stop.

## Conventions
- <language, framework, layout>
- Dates: compute in the business time zone explicitly; store UTC, render local.

## Traps
